Webfonts are embedded locally in the client bundle. There are no runtime font
CDN requests. This font pairing follows the film's interface design language;
it does not reproduce a separately commissioned MOSS logo typeface.

550W wordmark

The local SVG is a hand-drawn interpretation of the thin red/white 550W mark
from The Wandering Earth. Visual reference inspected:
https://store.kde.org/p/1981712/
https://images.pling.com/img/00/00/70/15/07/1981712/splash.png
No image was copied into the SVG. This is an unofficial tribute, not official
extracted artwork or an endorsement by the film's rights holders.

Department insignia

Sidebar SVGs are hand-drawn small-size reductions of the UEG polar globe and
laurel emblem, the Gabon Joint Research Base seal, and the UEG Spaceflight
Control Center mark. Seal lettering is omitted for legibility at 18px.
Visual references inspected:
https://www.gcores.com/articles/162106 (film art-direction account)
https://www.bilibili.com/opus/880972516256907282 (making-of book insignia)
The reference scans are not distributed in this package. These are unofficial
UI adaptations; the film's insignia are not claimed as original MIT artwork.
